1
00:00:01,417 --> 00:00:03,738
As Uke comes to strike the side of your head

2
00:00:03,819 --> 00:00:06,419
lead the strike around in a big circular movement

3
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:09,031
as he comes round raise the arm up

4
00:00:09,332 --> 00:00:12,453
step in deeply dropping your body 
below his center

5
00:00:12,454 --> 00:00:13,684
as you do so

6
00:00:13,685 --> 00:00:17,985
control Uke´s body, 
taking him over your hips for the throw.

